{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/3621","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/3621/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/3621/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/3621/events","html_url":"https://github.com/yetone/magpie/issues/3621","id":6025938033,"node_id":"I_kwDOUns_9M8AAAABZyyEcQ","number":3621,"title":"Linux 自启：没有包自带的条目时，magpie 写进去的 Exec 是带版本号的真实路径，升级回收后失效","user":{"login":"JoeyWu-tech","id":71250493,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjUwNDkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71250493?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoeyWu-tech","html_url":"https://github.com/JoeyWu-tech","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoeyWu-tech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoeyWu-tech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoeyWu-tech/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoeyWu-tech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoeyWu-tech/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoeyWu-tech/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoeyWu-tech/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoeyWu-tech/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoeyWu-tech/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-25T15:13:29Z","updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:56:26Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"从 #3372 拆出来的另一半。\n\n系统目录里没有 magpie.desktop 时，`magpie autostart on` 往 `~/.config/autostart/magpie.desktop` 写的是自己的条目，Exec 来自 `internal/autostart` 的 `self()`：`os.Executable()` 再 `EvalSymlinks`。装在带版本号目录里的 magpie，这个路径就是 `/nix/store/<hash>-magpie-<版本>/bin/magpie`、`.../Cellar/magpie/<版本>/bin/magpie` 这种。升级并回收旧版本之后文件没了，登录时什么都不启动，开关却还显示开（`enabled()` 只看有没有 Type 和 Exec）。Linux 上 `refresh()` 是空的，也没有机会把它改回来。\n\n`magpie daemon install` 处理过同一件事：`daemon.pick` 在 PATH 上的 `magpie` 解析到同一个文件时，写 PATH 上的那个路径（Nix profile、Homebrew 的链接升级后还指向新版本），`go run` 的临时构建也会拒绝。autostart 的 `self()` 这两步都没有，它在 autostart 包里，也不能直接用 daemon 的。\n\n#3372 的补丁只管包里自带条目的情况（那时 on 不再写路径），这个没动。我可以接着做。\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/3621/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/3621/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}